      "title": {
        "en": "Na dworcu"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "At the station, *na dworcu*, you check *rozkład jazdy* (the timetable): when the train, *pociąg*, *odjeżdża* (leaves) and *przyjeżdża* (arrives), and from which *peron* (platform). You ask questions *w informacji*, at the information desk, and buy a ticket *w kasie*, at the ticket office. PKP is the Polish railway, *Polskie Koleje Państwowe*."
      }
    }
  ],
